@@ -85,3 +85,8 @@ Decide keeps explicit approval and returns receipt/accounting state; automatic p
 offered model on duplicate or accounting failure. `usageRecoveryPending` means a recovery instruction
 was saved at receipt time, not that cold reconciliation has completed. Missing result acknowledgement
 never proves inference did not run. Both consumers expose/retain the declared observed usage fields.
+
+Automatic foreground waiting races the original Stop/deadline against the one shared operation.
+The existing residency owner retains unfinished receipt/accounting settlement; it never republishes
+a late tier into another turn. A slow unknown-intent write cannot dispatch after cancellation.
+Delayed ledger/result acknowledgement retains the same ID and observed facts, with no inference replay.
